translate schinese_rewrite snowman_win_f4d100f5:

    "你在雪堆周围搜寻，找到一块胡萝卜和煤炭！"

translate schinese_rewrite snowman_win_f8a9cbde:

    "你在雪堆周围搜寻，找到一块胡萝卜。"

translate schinese_rewrite snowman_lose_864ed754:

